  "description": "Lookout Theater \u2014 a self-hosted 3D situational-awareness console: live aircraft, ships, satellites, quakes and public cameras on a CesiumJS globe; an assistant with a sensitivity firewall; hash-sealed cases; a recorder for your own receiver.",
  "scripts": {
